om/">Math and seeded random numbers</a><a href="/docs/collection-tools/">Collection helpers</a><a href="/docs/text-encoding/">Text and byte encodings</a><a href="/docs/binary-memory/">Binary values and memory streams</a><a href="/docs/files-paths/">Files and host paths</a><a href="/docs/os-directories/">Platform information and directories</a><a href="/docs/logging/">Logging</a><a href="/docs/channels/">Topic subscriptions</a><a href="/docs/url-http/">URLs and HTTP clients</a><a href="/docs/compiler-workflow/">Running and building applications</a><a href="/docs/console-output/">Writing to the console</a><a href="/docs/json-data/">Reading JSON data</a><a href="/docs/calendar-time/" aria-current="page">Dates and clocks</a></details></nav></aside><article class="guide-article"><p class="eyebrow">LEARN VOID</p><h1 class="page-title">Dates and clocks</h1><p class="guide-tagline">Validate a calendar date and choose between wall time and elapsed time.</p><figure class="guide-code"><figcaption>calendar-time.void<a href="/docs/snippets/calendar-time.void" download>Download source</a></figcaption><pre tabindex="0" aria-label="Dates and clocks source"><code data-source="/docs/snippets/calendar-time.void"><span class="keyword">use</span> time
