+    <span class="keyword">if</span> time.make_date(<span class="number">2024</span>, <span class="number">2</span>, february_day <span class="keyword">as</span> <span class="keyword">i64</span>) <span class="keyword">is</span> Ok(<span class="keyword">var</span> valid):
+        <span class="keyword">return</span> february_day
+    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span></code></pre><div class="guide-result" data-source="/docs/snippets/calendar-time.void" data-input="29" data-expected="29">Input <strong>29</strong><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>Expected result <strong>29</strong></div></figure><section id="date"><h2>Check a calendar day</h2><p>February 2024 has a leap day. <code>time.make_date</code> returns a result, so the caller can handle an invalid day without constructing an invalid date. Try 29, then 30.</p></section><section id="clock"><h2>Choose the right clock</h2><p><code>time.now_utc()</code> asks for an instant on the wall clock. Use <code>time.monotonic_now()</code> to measure elapsed time within a process. Both queries can fail.</p></section><section id="zone"><h2>Resolve local time</h2><p>A local date and clock reading do not uniquely identify an instant across daylight-saving transitions. <code>time.resolve_local</code> takes an explicit choice with a rejecting default. Handle an ambiguous or missing local time at the boundary.</p></section><p class="muted">Continue learning with <a href="/docs/errors/">Recoverable errors</a>.</p><nav class="guide-pager" aria-label="Guide navigation"><a href="/docs/">← All guides</a></nav></article><nav class="guide-toc" aria-label="On this page"><span>ON THIS PAGE</span><a href="#date">Check a calendar day</a><a href="#clock">Choose the right clock</a><a href="#zone">Resolve local time</a></nav></div></main><footer><div class="container footer-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M2 5h12l13 23-6 11z"/><path fill="#6b779b" d="M17 5h11l-6 10z"/><path fill="#303b64" d="M31 5h11L29 28l-6-10z"/></svg><span>VOID <small>LANGUAGE</small></span></a><p>Native code. Clear intent.</p><div><a href="/docs/syntax/">Docs</a><a href="/docs/">All guides</a><a href="/github/">GitHub ↗</a></div></div></footer><div class="sr-only" id="announcement" role="status